Notes on what this package uses but does not include:

- The score-vs-hits plots and the video caption are set in DejaVu Sans, the font bundled with matplotlib. DejaVu Fonts
  are free software under the DejaVu Fonts licence (Bitstream Vera Fonts licence with the Arev additions:
  https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html). The font is not included in this folder.
- The drum sounds in the videos are synthesized by tools/soundtrack.py, which is part of this package and under the MIT
  licence above. No samples, recordings or third-party sounds are used.
